    "semantic_summary": "This component defines the ClearMask enumeration, which serves as a configuration utility for managing rendering buffer states in a WebGL context. It encapsulates bit flags corresponding to standard WebGL2 buffers, including color, depth, and stencil. The enum allows for combining these flags using bitwise OR operations to specify precise clearing requirements for rendering surfaces."
